# Sovereign Standalone App: Overhaul Plan

The objective is to create a **completely standalone** native desktop application for the Sovereign AI Ecosystem. This will be a distinct piece of software, physically decoupled from the AppForge web app builder, providing a true "Antigravity-like" management experience.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Complete Decoupling**: We are moving the Sovereign UI out of the `src/` folder of your web project and into its own dedicated micro-project. This ensures that when you open the "Sovereign AI" app, it is a dedicated tool for your swarm, not a page in your website builder.

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Sovereign UI Workspace]

#### [NEW] [sovereign-ui/](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/sovereign-ui)

A dedicated, lightweight React + Vite project exclusively for the Sovereign interface.

- Includes its own [package.json](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/package.json), [vite.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/vite.config.ts), and asset folder.
- Contains the [AdminSovereign](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/AdminSovereign.tsx#39-319) dashboard as its main entry point.

#### [NEW] [install_sovereign_ui.ps1](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/install_sovereign_ui.ps1)

